diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index cd492ac..688c111 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,8 @@
 - An `OFD` scan sets the new status `out_for_delivery` instead of `in_transit`.
 - Fixed: a parcel of exactly 30 kg was refused. The message for heavier parcels now reads
   `parcel over the 30 kg limit: {weight} kg`.
+- Tracking numbers carry the S10 check digit (mod 11, weights 8 6 4 2 3 5 9 7), which the carrier's
+  scanners now validate.
 
 ## 1.4.0 - 2026-09-30
 
diff --git a/docs/reference.md b/docs/reference.md
index 2e2bc4b..73d4969 100644
--- a/docs/reference.md
+++ b/docs/reference.md
@@ -99,7 +99,7 @@ scan.
 | fact | value | meaning |
 |---|---|---|
 | `tracking number` | `PP{serial}{check}GB` | eight-digit serial from the booking sequence, then one check digit |
-| `check digit` | `mod 10, weights 3 1` | how the check digit is computed from the eight serial digits |
+| `check digit` | `mod 11, weights 8 6 4 2 3 5 9 7` | how the check digit is computed from the eight serial digits: 11 minus the weighted sum mod 11, with 10 written as 0 and 11 as 5 |
 
